#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:2
msgid "Chunk-Size Negotiation"
msgstr "块大小协商"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:4
msgid ""
"The vLLM multiprocess connector negotiates a concrete LMCache chunk size "
"at startup. This keeps chunk boundaries aligned with every vLLM KV cache "
"group, including hybrid-attention, recurrent-state, and decode-context-"
"parallel (DCP) layouts."
msgstr "vLLM 多进程连接器在启动时协商具体的 LMCache 块大小。这保持了每个 vLLM KV Cache 组的块边界对齐，包括混合注意力、递归状态和解码上下文并行 (DCP) 布局。"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:10
msgid "Final chunk size"
msgstr "最终块大小"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:12
msgid ""
"``lmcache server --chunk-size`` is the minimum, not necessarily the final"
" value. The connector computes the effective token span of every "
"cacheable KV group, excluding scratch groups, and sends their least "
"common multiple as the required alignment::"
msgstr "``lmcache server --chunk-size`` 是最小值，而不一定是最终值。连接器计算每个可缓存 KV 组的有效令牌跨度（不包括临时组），并将它们的最小公倍数作为所需的对齐方式::"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:21
msgid ""
"For attention groups under DCP, the effective span is ``block_size * "
"decode_context_parallel_size``. Recurrent-state groups use their physical"
" block size because their state is replicated rather than DCP sharded."
msgstr "对于 DCP 下的注意力组，有效跨度为 ``block_size * decode_context_parallel_size``。递归状态组使用其物理块大小，因为它们的状态是复制的，而不是 DCP 分片的。"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:26
msgid "For example, with ``--chunk-size 256``:"
msgstr "例如，使用 ``--chunk-size 256``："

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:28
msgid "an alignment of 256 resolves to a final chunk size of 256;"
msgstr "256 的对齐最终解析为 256 的块大小；"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:29
msgid "an alignment of 544 resolves to 544;"
msgstr "对齐为 544 解析为 544；"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:30
msgid "an alignment of 544 with ``--chunk-size 600`` resolves to 1088; and"
msgstr "一个 544 的对齐与 ``--chunk-size 600`` 解析为 1088；并且"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:31
msgid "group spans 32 and 48 have an alignment of 96, so the final size is 288."
msgstr "组跨度 32 和 48 的对齐为 96，因此最终大小为 288。"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:33
msgid ""
"One MP server has one immutable final chunk size. After the first client "
"selects it, another model can share that server only when the selected "
"size is also a multiple of the new model's required alignment. Use "
"separate MP servers for incompatible models. When a vLLM deployment uses "
"multiple MP servers, every server must return the same final size."
msgstr "一个 MP 服务器具有一个不可变的最终块大小。在第一个客户端选择后，只有当所选大小也是新模型所需对齐的倍数时，另一个模型才能共享该服务器。对于不兼容的模型，请使用单独的 MP 服务器。当 vLLM 部署使用多个 MP 服务器时，每个服务器必须返回相同的最终大小。"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:40
msgid "Initialization flow"
msgstr "初始化流程"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:42
msgid ""
"vLLM resolves its KV cache groups. ``LMCacheMPConnector`` computes the "
"required alignment from their effective token spans."
msgstr "vLLM 解析其 KV Cache 组。``LMCacheMPConnector`` 根据它们的有效令牌跨度计算所需的对齐。"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:44
msgid ""
"The scheduler adapter and each worker adapter send "
"``NEGOTIATE_CHUNK_SIZE`` before issuing normal cache operations."
msgstr "调度器适配器和每个工作适配器在发出正常的缓存操作之前发送 ``NEGOTIATE_CHUNK_SIZE``。"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:46
msgid ""
"The MP server rounds its configured minimum up, then binds the resolved "
"size to the token hasher, session manager, optional CacheBlend matcher, "
"telemetry, and coordinator membership."
msgstr "MP 服务器将其配置的最小值向上取整，然后将解析的大小绑定到令牌哈希器、会话管理器、可选的 CacheBlend 匹配器、遥测和协调器成员资格。"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:49
msgid ""
"The server returns the final size. The connector verifies that it is "
"compatible with every cache group; a multi-server scheduler also verifies"
" that all servers agree."
msgstr "服务器返回最终大小。连接器验证它与每个缓存组兼容；多服务器调度器还验证所有服务器是否一致。"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:52
msgid "Workers register their KV caches using the negotiated size."
msgstr "工作节点使用协商的大小注册它们的 KV Cache。"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:54
msgid ""
"The MP server rejects a resize after sessions have started. It also does "
"not report negotiation success until every chunk-size binding callback "
"succeeds; a retry resumes at the first callback that did not complete."
msgstr "MP 服务器在会话开始后拒绝调整大小。它也不会报告协商成功，直到每个块大小绑定回调成功；重试将在第一个未完成的回调处恢复。"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:59
msgid "Restart recovery"
msgstr "重启恢复"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:61
msgid ""
"The scheduler and worker adapters keep the negotiated size in memory. "
"Their heartbeat threads detect an unhealthy-to-healthy transition after "
"an MP server restart and perform recovery before marking that server "
"healthy:"
msgstr "调度程序和工作适配器将协商的大小保存在内存中。它们的心跳线程在 MP 服务器重启后检测到不健康到健康的转换，并在标记该服务器为健康之前执行恢复："

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:65
msgid "Re-negotiate using the original required alignment."
msgstr "重新协商使用原始所需的对齐方式。"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:66
msgid "Verify that the recovered size exactly matches the adapter's cached size."
msgstr "验证恢复的大小是否与适配器的缓存大小完全匹配。"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:67
msgid ""
"On workers, re-register the KV cache handles and any experimental "
"dispatcher state."
msgstr "在工作节点上，重新注册 KV Cache 句柄和任何实验性调度器状态。"

#: ../../source/mp/chunk_size_negotiation.rst:70
msgid ""
"If any step fails, the server remains unhealthy from that adapter's point"
" of view and normal cache operations stay in degraded mode. Recovery is "
"attempted again after the next successful heartbeat. The heartbeat "
"interval defaults to 10 seconds and can be changed with "
"``lmcache.mp.heartbeat_interval`` in ``kv_connector_extra_config``."
msgstr "如果任何步骤失败，从适配器的角度来看，服务器将保持不健康，正常的缓存操作将处于降级模式。恢复将在下一个成功的心跳后再次尝试。心跳间隔默认为 10 秒，可以通过 ``lmcache.mp.heartbeat_interval`` 在 ``kv_connector_extra_config`` 中更改。"

